Register only the sha256sum toolchains

The module registers a toolchain for every coreutils tool and every way it
can provide one, and each build configuration analyses all of them during
toolchain resolution. bazel_env.bzl, through which the module is
reached, resolves only the sha256sum toolchain type.

The patch changes one line of the module's MODULE.bazel and carries the three
around it, too little of the file to attribute.

License: MIT (rules_coreutils 1.0.1)

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -200,4 +200,4 @@
     )
 ]
 
-register_toolchains("//coreutils/toolchain/...")
+register_toolchains("//coreutils/toolchain/sha256sum:all")
